---
// A big sans-serif line that pulls one idea out of the text.
---

<p class="pull"><slot /></p>

<style>
  .pull {
    clear: both;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.27;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    padding: 24px 0;
  }
</style>
